<title>USA: N.Y. State Dorm Authority to sell $20 mln Thursday.</title>
<headline>N.Y. State Dorm Authority to sell $20 mln Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York State Dormitory Authority plans to sell $20 million bonds, for Long Island University, at 1100 EST Thursday, a market source said.</p>
<p>The deal is insured by Asset Guaranty Insurance Co.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
